<translation id="7461356015007898716">Ili upate masasisho yajayo ya uwu chromium, utahitaji kutumia toleo la Windows 10 au toleo jipya zaidi. Kompyuta hii inatumia toleo la Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="7467949745582939695">Ungependa kufungua uwu chromium tena?</translation>
<translation id="7483335560992089831">Haiwezi kusakinisha toleo sawia la uwu chromium ambalo linaendeshwa hivi sasa. Tafadhali funga uwu chromium na ujaribu tena.</translation>
